            0.12,
            0.884,
            0.187
          ],
          "content": "2. Use a protractor to draw angles having the following degree measures: a. $1 1 0 ^ { \\circ }$ b. $4 0 ^ { \\circ }$ c. $7 5 ^ { \\circ }$ d. $1 1 2 ^ { \\circ }$ e. $1 3 4 ^ { \\circ }$"
